				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">350 </p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="59054" left="288" top="9848.25" width="16.5" height="12" align-x="293.25" align-y="9858" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">us </p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="59055" left="42" top="9866.25" width="345.75" height="24" align-x="48.75" align-y="9876" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Jika waktu selisih delay propagasi sinyal melebihi setting ini maka isi data akan dibuang karena dapat menyebabkan mal operasi.</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="59056" left="42" top="9908.25" width="172.5" height="12" align-x="72.75" align-y="9918" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">2.4.7 Communication failure time (CFT):</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="59057" left="222" top="9908.25" width="13.5" height="12" align-x="229.5" align-y="9918" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">10 </p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="59058" left="240" top="9908.25" width="8.25" height="12" align-x="245.25" align-y="9918" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">s </p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="59059" left="42" top="9926.25" width="372.75" height="48" align-x="71.25" align-y="9936" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">CFT adalah waktu selama eror komunikasi harus tetap mendetect adanya eror sebelum channel dideclared "failed". Digunakan untuk menghindari alarm supervisi komunikasi dan alarm proteksi non-operasi terpengaruh oleh noise / interupsi link komunikasi</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="59060" left="42" top="10016.25" width="171" height="24" align-x="72.75" align-y="10026" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">2.4.8 Communication fail mode (CFM) :<sp count="17"/>:</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="59061" left="216" top="10016.25" width="54.75" height="12" align-x="231.75" align-y="10026" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Channel 1</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="59062" left="42" top="10040.25" width="121.5" height="12" align-x="50.25" align-y="10050" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">2.4.9 GPS synch : Disabled</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="59063" left="42" top="10070.25" width="140.25" height="12" align-x="50.25" align-y="10080" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">2.4.10 Char Mod Time : 500 ms </p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="59064" left="42" top="10088.25" width="372.75" height="36" align-x="51" align-y="10098" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Char Mod Time digunakan untuk mengatasi masalah transient pada jalur komunikasi yang akan mereset propagation value ke nilai aslinya jika terjadi perubahan propagasi selama waktu perioda (yang ditentukan user)</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="59065" left="42" top="10136.25" width="108.75" height="12" align-x="52.5" align-y="10146" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">2.4.11 Alarm Level : 25%</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="59066" left="42" top="10160.25" width="147" height="12" align-x="52.5" align-y="10170" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">2.4.12 Prop delay Stats : Enabled</p>
			</text>
		</region>
